<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus accepts Dreyfus barley tender.</title>
<headline>Cyprus accepts Dreyfus barley tender.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus Grain Commission on Friday said it accepted the tender of L. Dreyfus Negoce Paris for the supply of 25,000 tonnes of barley at $145.39 per tonne C&amp;F, the commission said in a statement.</p>
<p>Shipment is scheduled between October 15 and 30.</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
</text>
